      "description": "Knowledge distillation began as a model-compression trick — Buciluă, Caruana and Niculescu-Mizil compressed an ensemble into a single net in 2006, and Hinton, Vinyals and Dean gave it its modern soft-target formulation in 2015 (now ~25.9k citations).",
